{
  "name": "cute-fat-fish-pet",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "private": true,
  "workspaces": [
    "src"
  ],
  "description": "Cute Fat Fish Pet — a chibi blue-haired maid who lives on your Windows desktop (source repository; build entry point)",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Mikolu",
  "_comment": [
    "=============== 仓库根清单：既是构建入口，也是 DSH 插件的「门面」 ===============",
    "插件的真实包在 src/：那里才有 lib/（宿主半侧 + 浏览器半侧构建产物）、assets/（106 个 webm）和 cordis.patch.yml。",
    "为什么根目录也声明 dsh.bundle —— 一批目录/工具只把『仓库根』当成安装目标，会生成",
    "    dsh plugin add github:12we21/cute-fat-fish-pet",
    "（dshbase 的 gen-catalog.py、bradeGithub/DSH-Plugins-Marketplace、ukinch605/awesome-dsh-hub 的收录条件、",
    "以及 dshfind 的 is_plugin 判定都是这个口径）。根清单没有 dsh.bundle 时，这条命令装不上任何东西，",
    "仓库也会被判成「不是插件」。子目录指向（#path:/src）依然有效，两种装法并存。",
    "main / exports 一律指向 src/ —— src/lib/index.js 里 PACKAGE_ROOT = resolve(new URL('..', import.meta.url))",
    "是模块相对解析，所以无论从仓库根装还是从 src/ 装，assets/ 都能找到。",
    "本清单不参与 Electron / NSIS 打包；打包入口是下面的 scripts（node build/build.mjs 等）。",
    "================================================"
  ],
  "main": "src/lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./src/lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./src/lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "types": "./src/lib/types/client/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./src/lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./src/cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./src/cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@electron-internal/extract-zip": "^1.0.5",
    "@electron/get": "^5.1.0"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-default-model": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-commands": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/12we21/cute-fat-fish-pet",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "toolchain": "node build/toolchain.mjs",
    "build": "node build/build.mjs",
    "list": "node build/build.mjs --list",
    "clean": "node build/build.mjs --clean",
    "paths": "node build/check-paths.mjs",
    "upstream": "node build/compare-upstream.mjs",
    "verify": "node stage/verify.mjs",
    "check": "node build/check-release.mjs",
    "nsi": "python build/nsi-syntax-check.py",
    "zip": "python build/mkzip.py",
    "exe": "python build/mkexe.py"
  }
}
